  <title>AA Extraction Pipeline — Sally May Saclauso</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
    :root{--bg:#fafafa;--surface:#fff;--text:#1a1a1a;--text-secondary:#6b7280;--accent:#2563eb;--accent-light:#eff6ff;--border:#e5e7eb;--radius:12px;--shadow-sm:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);--shadow-md:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.06);--max-width:760px}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.7;font-size:15px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(250,250,250,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
    nav .nav-inner{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    nav .logo{font-weight:700;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.3px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text)}
    nav .back-link{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-secondary);text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;transition:color .2s}
    nav .back-link:hover{color:var(--accent)}
    .hero-section{padding-top:120px;padding-bottom:56px;max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px}
    .project-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:12px}
    .hero-section h1{font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.8px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:16px}
    .hero-section .subtitle{font-size:17px;color:var(--text-secondary);max-width:600px;margin-bottom:24px}
    .tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px}
    .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;letter-spacing:.2px}
    .tag.blue{background:#eff6ff;color:#2563eb}.tag.green{background:#ecfdf5;color:#059669}.tag.purple{background:#f5f3ff;color:#7c3aed}.tag.orange{background:#fff7ed;color:#ea580c}.tag.pink{background:#fdf2f8;color:#db2777}.tag.gray{background:#f3f4f6;color:#4b5563}
    .divider{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
    .divider hr{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
    section{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;padding:56px 24px}
    section h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin-bottom:16px}
    section p{color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px}
    .card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px 32px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
    .card h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
    .card p{margin-bottom:0}
    .flow-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
    .flow-step{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:24px}
    .flow-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
    .flow-content h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
    .flow-content p{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0}
    .feature-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .feature-list li{padding:16px 20px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px}
    .feature-list li .num{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);min-width:24px}
    .stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
    .stat{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;text-align:center}
    .stat .value{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:4px}
    .stat .label{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:500}
    .cta-box{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:40px;text-align:center}
    .cta-box h2{margin-bottom:8px}
    .cta-box p{max-width:400px;margin:0 auto 20px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
    .btn-primary:hover{background:#1d4ed8;transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
    footer{text-align:center;padding:32px 24px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
    .fade-in{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
    .fade-in.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    @media(max-width:640px){.hero-section{padding-top:100px}.hero-section h1{font-size:26px}.stat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav><div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="index.html" class="logo">Sally May Saclauso</a>
    <a href="index.html#projects" class="back-link">&larr; All Projects</a>
  </div></nav>

  <div class="hero-section">
    <div class="project-label">Project 03</div>
    <h1>Acquisition Analysis Extraction Pipeline</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">An end-to-end document processing pipeline for M&amp;A due diligence — pulling payroll, HR, and financial files from Google Drive, extracting structured data with AI, and routing clean records to Google Sheets.</p>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag blue">Google Drive</span>
      <span class="tag green">Google Sheets</span>
      <span class="tag purple">Claude AI</span>
      <span class="tag pink">M&amp;A Due Diligence</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"><hr/></div>

  <section class="fade-in">
    <h2>The Problem</h2>
    <p>During mergers and acquisitions, due diligence teams face mountains of unstructured documents — payroll records, HR files, financial statements — scattered across shared drives in inconsistent formats. Manually extracting and normalising this data is slow, error-prone, and creates serious PII exposure risks. Teams need structured, auditable data fast, but can't afford mistakes.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"><hr/></div>

  <section class="fade-in">
    <h2>The Solution</h2>
    <p>I built the AA (Acquisition Analysis) pipeline as a custom Claude skill that automates the entire extraction flow. Documents go in from Google Drive, structured records come out in Google Sheets — with PII tokenisation, confidence scoring, human-in-the-loop review, and a full audit trail at every step.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"><hr/></div>

  <section class="fade-in">
    <h2>Pipeline Flow</h2>
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-icon" style="background:#eff6ff">&#128194;</div>
      <div class="flow-content"><h4>Document Ingestion</h4><p>Pull payroll, HR, and financial files from designated Google Drive folders. Supports PDFs, spreadsheets, and document formats.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-icon" style="background:#f5f3ff">&#129302;</div>
      <div class="flow-content"><h4>AI-Powered Extraction</h4><p>Claude processes each document, extracting structured fields — employee records, salary data, benefits, org structure — regardless of source format.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-icon" style="background:#ecfdf5">&#128256;</div>
      <div class="flow-content"><h4>Normalisation &amp; PII Tokenisation</h4><p>Extracted data is normalised to canonical schemas. Personal identifiers are tokenised to protect sensitive information throughout the pipeline.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-icon" style="background:#fff7ed">&#9878;</div>
      <div class="flow-content"><h4>Confidence Gating</h4><p>Each extracted record receives a confidence score. High-confidence records route to canonical tables; low-confidence records route to the HITL review queue.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-icon" style="background:#fdf2f8">&#128101;</div>
      <div class="flow-content"><h4>Human-in-the-Loop Review</h4><p>Flagged records land in a structured review queue where human reviewers can validate, correct, or escalate. Decisions feed back into the system.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-icon" style="background:#f0fdf4">&#128202;</div>
      <div class="flow-content"><h4>Canonical Tables &amp; Dashboard</h4><p>Clean records populate Google Sheets canonical tables. A live dashboard provides real-time visibility into extraction progress, exception rates, and data quality.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-step">
      <div class="flow-icon" style="background:#f3f4f6">&#128220;</div>
      <div class="flow-content"><h4>Audit Trail &amp; Retention</h4><p>Every action is logged to an audit trail. A retention purge job handles data lifecycle management per compliance requirements.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"><hr/></div>

  <section class="fade-in">
    <h2>Key Features</h2>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Confidence-gated routing</strong> — automatic triage ensures humans only review what the AI can't handle confidently.</div></li>
      <li><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>PII tokenisation</strong> — sensitive data is protected at the extraction stage, not as an afterthought.</div></li>
      <li><span class="num">03</span><div><strong>Full audit trail</strong> — every extraction, routing decision, and review action is logged for compliance.</div></li>
      <li><span class="num">04</span><div><strong>Live dashboard</strong> — real-time visibility into pipeline health, exception rates, and completion progress.</div></li>
      <li><span class="num">05</span><div><strong>Retention purge</strong> — automated data lifecycle management ensures documents don't persist beyond their required window.</div></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"><hr/></div>

  <section class="fade-in">
    <h2>Results &amp; Impact</h2>
    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat"><div class="value">7</div><div class="label">Pipeline Stages</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="value">100%</div><div class="label">Audit Coverage</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="value">PII</div><div class="label">Tokenised at Source</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"><hr/></div>

  <section class="fade-in">
    <h2>Tools Used</h2>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag blue">Google Drive API</span>
      <span class="tag green">Google Sheets</span>
      <span class="tag purple">Claude AI</span>
      <span class="tag orange">Custom Claude Skill</span>
      <span class="tag gray">PII Tokenisation</span>
      <span class="tag pink">HITL Workflows</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"><hr/></div>

  <section>
    <div class="cta-box fade-in">
      <h2>Interested in this project?</h2>
      <p>I'd love to discuss how AI-powered document extraction could accelerate your due diligence process.</p>
      <a href="index.html#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

